      "whyThisWorks": "Layered tamagoyaki technique creates a tender, structured omelette. Octopus preserves the takoyaki reference; whole-wheat panko adds crunch. Replacing bottled sweet/salty condiments with tomato-tamarind glaze plus yuzu-yoghurt aioli removes common additive and added-sugar pitfalls while keeping sweet-savory umami.",
